{"id":"n26500-1-7","stage":1,"title":"부지런하다 · 勤奋","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26500-1-7-1","ko":"난 항상 새벽 여섯 시에 일어나서 아침 운동을 가.","zh":"我总是清晨六点起床去晨练。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"항상","meaning":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","explanation":"항상：总，总是，老，老是，经常。","readings":[{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83162","senseId":"1","lemma":"항상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}},{"text":"새벽","meaning":"清晨，拂晓","explanation":"새벽：清晨，拂晓。","readings":[{"term":"새벽","audio":"/audio/d0a36389c6b198a158ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62740","senseId":"1","lemma":"새벽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새벽","audio":"/audio/d0a36389c6b198a158ee.mp3"}},{"text":"여섯","meaning":"六","explanation":"여섯：六。","readings":[{"term":"여섯","audio":"/audio/e3da184cbf43240adbd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29614","senseId":"1","lemma":"여섯","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여섯","audio":"/audio/e3da184cbf43240adbd9.mp3"}},{"text":"시에","meaning":"点，点钟","explanation":"시：点，点钟；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시에","audio":"/audio/d114a7f7c3eca4fa0970.mp3"}},{"text":"일어나서","meaning":"起，起床，起来","explanation":"일어나다：起，起床，起来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"일어나다","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71696","senseId":"2","lemma":"일어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일어나서","audio":"/audio/9b19cee6ad81266fd49b.mp3"}},{"text":"아침","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨。","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}},{"text":"운동을","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동을","audio":"/audio/0ba24f283476666840e3.mp3"}},{"text":"가.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가","audio":"/audio/64ee5293d31bc58b72d7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"f1d42a32366087dd","term":"항상","zh":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3","entryId":"83162","definition":"无论什么时候都没变地。","pronunciation":["항상"]},{"id":"d0a36389c6b198a1","term":"새벽","zh":"清晨，拂晓","audio":"/audio/d0a36389c6b198a158ee.mp3","entryId":"62740","definition":"日出时分。","pronunciation":["새벽"]},{"id":"e3da184cbf43240a","term":"여섯","zh":"六","audio":"/audio/e3da184cbf43240adbd9.mp3","entryId":"29614","definition":"五加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["여섣"]},{"id":"bfa42cf6a12e9123","term":"시","zh":"点，点钟","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3","entryId":"65108","definition":"计时单位，表示一天二十四小时中的某一个。","pronunciation":["시"]},{"id":"d57c47b0949440ff","term":"일어나다","zh":"起，起床，起来","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3","entryId":"71696","definition":"从睡眠中醒来。",