a27","term":"부지런하다","zh":"勤奋，勤快，勤勉，勤恳","audio":"/audio/c17f7a33ba0f8a274e48.mp3","entryId":"26500","definition":"具有不偷懒、坚持不懈、努力做事的倾向。","pronunciation":["부지런하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1cbb4b43e14dfaf4e3ad.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.86,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26500","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":36,"sequenceScore":1.5853,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我总是清晨六点起床去晨练。","你真勤快。","我昨天去看了电影，还见到电影演员了呢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我总是清晨六点起床去晨练。","你真勤快。","我昨天去看了电影，还见到电影演员了呢。"],"answer":1}]}
